m] border-l-4 border-accent"><h4 class="text-gray-800 font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-lg mb-4">What is Non-GMO Animal Feed Certification?</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">This certification ensures that feed materials used in animal nutrition are sourced and processed without genetically modified ingredients. It covers the entire supply chain from raw material sourcing through manufacturing and distribution, ensuring that non-GMO integrity is maintained at every stage.</p></div></div><div class="relative rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-gray-200 h-[400px] sm:h-[500px]"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367640/eurocert/F17.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80" alt="Non-GMO Animal Feed"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-navy via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 md:py-24 relative z-10 bg-navy-light/20 border-y border-gray-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="text-center mb-16 md:mb-24"><h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-display font-black text-gray-800 uppercase tracking-widest leading-none">Key <span class="text-accent">Requirements</span></h2><p class="text-gray-500 mt-6 font-tech uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">Comprehensive Non-GMO Feed Chain Verification</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="glass-panel p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-[2rem] group hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:border-accent hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(91,141,239,0.3)] hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-400"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 border border-accent/30 group-hover:scale-110 transition"><svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2